                <pb facs="0470" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1942v06/pg456"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.20 Defense (M)/7842: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Des
                            Portes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-07-21T21:00:00-04:00">July 21, 1942—9
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>283. For Holt. Your 251, July 20. Rubber Reserve, Board of Economic Warfare and
                    Department believe that you have been exceptionally successful in obtaining
                    agreement on basis outlined, and you are authorized to sign an agreement on this
                    basis. Please advise when signature completed so that a press release may be
                    issued and also forward as soon as possible copies of signed agreement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
